"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1020006","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"243f09464bcd658512492317f85d285e9221dfc478b001b4e0fdf01d4cca7009","compact":"4d233bf648f0012e5d683700e904ded841089f2e48aafbe4f354de13eb2b5e70","nasal":"5fbc2768ff36405deb9f3f8859b88b46935e4eca0b6fc9067dfd37fa18012ab2"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-20-7","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":20,"verse":7,"english":"The descendant of Raghu is famed over the three worlds as righteous-souled. Do you maintain your habit of adhering to promise; for it does not behove you to act unrighteously.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-21-7"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1020007","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"83acada14767856431ea8757b70fe657a491ccc7f4e81de10036e0be0f02f543","compact":"ad415e83c4a98be37c493a43a6c3fc6ed7a09d3ae9fc6333c2b973c096552ce9","nasal":"ad415e83c4a98be37c493a43a6c3fc6ed7a09d3ae9fc6333c2b973c096552ce9"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-20-8","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":20,"verse":8,"english":"If having promised, I will do so, you do not act up to your word, the merit you have achieved by digging tanks, shall come to naught, therefore do you renounce Rāma!","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.441,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-21-8"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1020008","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"eca015d4c3f9498ed2a10aa7defdd80febd2d5c7866e36e723efc735c2c19cd3","compact":"dc5b523db4dc9b2fcf4d4d10ab1c466347e45b4abaeede63e68c4e3798a1f3be","nasal":"dc5b523db4dc9b2fcf4d4d10ab1c466347e45b4abaeede63e68c4e3798a1f3be"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-20-9","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":20,"verse":9,"english":"Accomplished or not accomplished in weapons, the Rākṣasas cannot 